    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Although he appears human, he is actually a high-ranking Angel who directly interacts with Einhasad and worships the Grail. Recently an ancient religious document found in the Tower of Insolence provided proof that the Grail is hidden in the Monastery of Silence. Since then, adherents of the Pagan Temple have frequently tried to steal it, but none has avoided the judgment of the Lord of Splendor. Angels Lv. 8 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Angels. M. Def. +5% Accuracy +10 Resistance to Holy +10% Atk. Spd. -5% Resistance to Dark -10% Resistance to debuffs +15% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Sword Lv. 3 One-handed Sword Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
